    "title": "Registered Sex Offender Arrested for Violation of Parole - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago On the evening of Thursday September 24, the Sacramento County Sheriff’s Office Sexual Assault Felony Enforcement (SAFE) Task Force Team conducted a compliance check of registered sex offender, Lloyd Edwards. Edwards was an active parolee and a registered sex offender in the County of Sacramento, after having been convicted for rapes in Chico in 2000, where he was sentenced to three life sentences, plus 51 years. Read full article",
